  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-21T10:26:33.438Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think the nuisance system is a bit to far depending on how it’s triggered. I have seen people all block a user for fun before. The rank system should be enough with the tools you gave us with the rank system. Other than that the mod team should handle people who are really a nuisance with temp bans and warnings. It should not be a trigger based system.",
